  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>The Repeating Blaster Carbine is an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Autofire\" title=\"Autofire\">Autofire</a> weapon that functions best at Short <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. The Repeating Blaster Carbine has difficulty hitting targets at longer <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ranges\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ranges\">Ranges</a>, and is ineffective against distant targets. </p><p>A&nbsp;Repeating Blaster Carbine requires a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> to operate. After 30 shots, the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> must be replaced. </p><p><b>Inaccurate:</b>&nbsp;This weapon cannot fire at targets at Long&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p>",
